        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana Small Satin Stainless Steel Bar Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 7/16 inch diameter contemporary stainless steel bar pull is excellent for cabinets and small appliances. It is available in a wide range of sizes ranging in overall length from 5-1/4 inches to 9-3/4 inches. All lengths have a 1 inch projection and are made from durable 12 mm solid stainless steel round stock. Since it is made from quality stainless steel, it will last for many years.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BPSM-specifications.gif?v=1704354587\" width=\"456\" height=\"361\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana Satin Stainless Steel Bar Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available in <a href=\"/products/medium-length-stainless-steel-bar-pulls-from-10-inch-16-inch-c-c-deltana-bpxxxxss-md\"><b>Medium Lengths</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/large-length-stainless-steel-bar-pulls-from-21-inches-40-inches-c-c-deltana-bpxxxxss-lg\"><b>Large Lengths</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana 7/16 Inch Diameter Stainless Steel Bar Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 7/16\" (12 mm)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BPSM-Specifications.pdf?v=1691095328\"><b>Deltana Bar Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>BP3000SS: Overall Length 5-1/4\" - Center to Center 3\"</li>\r\n<li>BP3750SS: Overall Length 5-7/8\" - Center to Center 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>BP3500SS: Overall Length 6-1/8\" - Center to Center 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>BP5000SS: Overall Length 7-1/4\" - Center to Center 5\"</li>\r\n<li>BP7500SS: Overall Length 9-3/4\" - Center to Center 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
